   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernization of Agricultural Services I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PRINCIPAL OBJECTIVE OF THIS PROJECT IS TO INCREASE THE PRODUCTIVITY OF THE AGRICULTURAL SECTOR AS WELL AS TO IMPROVE PRODUCTION QUALITY BY MEANS OF STRENGTHENING THE NATIONAL SYSTEM OF GENERATION AND TRANSFER OF AGRICULTURAL TECHNOLOGY AND THE MODERNIZATION OF AGRICULTURAL HEALTH SERVICES IN THE MEDIUM TERM.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
